1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Count the roof beasts: only one building in China is allowed 10.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Look at a palace roof — a line of little animals rides each corner ridge.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
The higher the hall's rank, the more beasts. Nine is usually the ceiling.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Only the Hall of Supreme Harmony gets a 10th — Hangshi, found on no other roof.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Next Forbidden City roof you see — how many did you count?
